    <!-- Not used by this binding directly — pinned to keep the Navigation family on one
         version. MAUI asks for Navigation.Fragment 2.8.9.1 while the pins here raise
         Common/Runtime/UI to 2.9.2.1, and NuGet resolves that split rather than failing
         (the long-standing NU1608 on this graph). The net10 band tolerated it; net9 does
         not — Fragment 2.8.9.1 cannot bind against the 2.9.2.1 assemblies, and the app
         build dies with 'Could not load file or assembly
